<section style="padding:72px 24px 40px;"><div style="max-width:860px;margin:0 auto;"><div class="rich"><p>A window well cover keeps rain, leaves, and snow out of the pit and keeps kids and pets from falling in. It also sits over what may be the only way out of a basement bedroom. We measure, fit, and replace <strong>window well covers in Lincoln</strong> and the surrounding towns, on standard galvanized wells and on oversized or odd-shaped egress wells that no stock cover fits.</p><p>Most covers run <strong>$150 to $600</strong> installed. Custom covers are quoted per well once we've measured it. Call <strong>(402) 261-0485</strong> for a free written estimate. If the cover is fine and the well behind it is the real problem, we'll tell you that too.</p></div></div></section>
<section style="padding:0 24px 64px;"><div style="max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;">
    <span class="kicker">What We Handle</span>
    <h2 class="section-heading" style="font-size:clamp(22px,3vw,32px);margin:0 0 28px;">Cover Work We Do</h2>
    <div class="feat-grid" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:20px;">
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #e3ded4;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(14,77,110,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Nunito Sans',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#0A3D5C;margin:0 0 8px;">Clear flat and bubble covers</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">Polycarbonate covers that let daylight into the basement. Flat sheets suit narrow wells. Domed bubble covers shed snow and leave more headroom over deeper wells.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #e3ded4;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(14,77,110,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Nunito Sans',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#0A3D5C;margin:0 0 8px;">Metal grate covers</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">Steel grates take more weight and stand up to foot traffic near walkways, but rain and leaves fall straight through them.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #e3ded4;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(14,77,110,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Nunito Sans',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#0A3D5C;margin:0 0 8px;">Custom-sized covers</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">Extra-wide egress wells, tiered wells, and non-standard shapes get a cover built to the measured outline. These are quoted per well.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #e3ded4;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(14,77,110,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Nunito Sans',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#0A3D5C;margin:0 0 8px;">Hinged egress covers</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">Covers over an egress window that lift or swing open from below, so someone inside can get out without a key or a tool.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #e3ded4;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(14,77,110,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Nunito Sans',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#0A3D5C;margin:0 0 8px;">Cracked cover replacement</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">Sun and cold leave polycarbonate yellow and brittle. A cracked sheet won't hold snow or a person's weight, so we replace it rather than patch it.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #e3ded4;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(14,77,110,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Nunito Sans',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#0A3D5C;margin:0 0 8px;">Hinge and fastener repair</h3>
